{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2759280/extras/Cast_Cards_Cropped.gif?t=1739782756\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Kumitantei\u2122: Old-School Slaughter</strong> is a murder-mystery tribute to retro anime and pop culture of 1980's Japan, underlined with a dark twist of horror and conspiracy!  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Stylistically inspired by Rumiko Takahashi and classic Japanese adventure games, blended with a wide variety of interwoven gametypes from deck-building to platforming to puzzle solving, and all tightly wrapped in a plot influenced by the Danganronpa series, <strong>Kumitantei\u2122 </strong>is a love letter to decades of ADVs that wears its <i>many</i> inspirations on its sleeve!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2759280/extras/Skill_Cards_Cropped.gif?t=1739782756\" /></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Enter</strong> into an engaging world of murder, mystery, and anemoic alternate history where solving complex cases is the key to unravelling the winding narrative! </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Meet</strong> a colourful ensemble cast of sixteen uniquely gifted Absolute students as they find themselves caught in a deadly Apathy Experiment, where their very humanity is put to the test! </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Trapped</strong> in Janus Institute's decrepit Bunker, will exploring and solving the mysteries of its past and present lead to means of escaping alive?</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Bond</strong> with fellow participants to earn their trust, investigate grisly crime scenes to find your evidence, and then leverage both to uncover the truth!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Battle</strong> your way through fast-paced Card Debates, Retro Minigames, and more to ensure the facts prevail and the true killer is discovered! These high stakes, high energy Clinical Trials can only end in bloodshed, whether it's the culprit's or <u>everyone else's!</u></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2759280/extras/Trust_Up_Shigure_Cropped.gif?t=1739782756\" /></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/2759280?t=1739782756","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2759280/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1739782756","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2759280/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1739782756","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2759280/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1739782756","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Steam Achievements","id":22},{"description":"Full controller support","id":28},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[1,2,5],"notes":"This game may contain content not appropriate for all ages, or may not be appropriate for viewing at work: Frequent Violence or Gore, General Mature Content, Some Nudity or Sexual Content"},"controller_support":"full","demos":[{"appid":3157240,"description":""}],"detailed_description":"<h1>Join The Community</h1><p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2759280/extras/JoinUsOnDiscord_QR.png?t=1739782756\" /></p></p><br><h1>About the Game</h1><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2759280/extras/Cast_Cards_Cropped.gif?t=1739782756\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Kumitantei\u2122: Old-School Slaughter</strong> is a murder-mystery tribute to ret